            "notes": "the infamous chain evoker! while it's true mercy doesn't get much from damage boost in stadium, this is the only dmg boost modifier in the game and - imho - it is worth it.\n\nit gives you 50 armor, takes mercy's usual 30% dmg increase to 35% and makes it so dmg boost gets you your ult just as fast as healing does. you'll farm your ult and - thanks to crep circle and 25% healing increase - points.\n\nand that's only on round 3!\n\nif you can't afford all 3, prioritize chain evoker and talon modification module.\n\nprioritize weapon power (you're still at 75 hp/second here!).",
